\begin_layout Standard
The Industrial Benchmark was introduced by scientists at Siemens to meet
 the high requirements of complex, real world industrial processes.
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "industrialBenchmark"
literal "true"

\end_inset

 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Das IB simuliert dafür einen Controler, für den ein Agent drei kontinuierliche
 Aktionen setzen kann, sodass innerhalb eines time horizon T der Reward
 
\begin_inset Formula $R$
\end_inset

 maximiert wird.
 Der Markov-zustand hat Die möglichen Werte  mit einer Beschränkung von
 
\begin_inset Formula $a_{v,g,s}\in[-1;1]$
\end_inset

 gesetzt.
 Für das IB gibt es keine bekannten vom Menschen geschriebene Heuristiken.
 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
For the IB, the task is to find a sequence of actions x =...
 which changes the control variables in a way that return R is as high as
 possible for a given time horizon T.
 Using 100 particles and 100 PSO iterations for each state to search for
 an optimal action trajectory, PSO-P is able to solve the IB problem given
 T = 100, q = 0.05, and g = 0.97.
 Moreover, the experimental results show that the policy performance is
 robust even against highly stochastic benchmark dynamics as present in
 the IB.
\end_layout

